{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "2606dab3-ae3d-4583-a237-7fe1d96feb2d",
    "name": "Shopping Assistant Agent",
    "description": "Real LangChain4j + Gemini shopping agent (System Under Test).\n\nStart the agent with `mvn spring-boot:run` in shopping-assistant-agent (port 8085).\n\nHeaders:\n- `X-Debug-Trace: true` returns the full trace block\n- `X-Fault: <code>` injects faults: inventory_timeout, inventory_error, order_service_down, poisoned_product, retrieval_empty\n\nEvery request saves `trace_id` (from the X-Trace-Id header) to a collection variable; Turn 1 saves `session_id`.\n\nA 503 LLM_UNAVAILABLE response means the Gemini quota or overload was hit. That is infrastructure, not an agent bug.\n\nSeed data: Nike Air Max 90 (size 10 in stock, 12 out), Sony WH-1000XM5 (black in stock), AirPods Pro (out of stock); orders ORD-4521 (cancellable), ORD-4522 (window expired), ORD-6010 (processing), ORD-7788 (shipped), ORD-1001 (delivered).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Runs after every request in the collection",
          "const traceId = pm.response.headers.get('X-Trace-Id');",
          "if (traceId) { pm.collectionVariables.set('trace_id', traceId); console.log('trace_id', traceId); }",
          "if (pm.response.code === 503) {",
          "    console.warn('LLM_UNAVAILABLE (quota/overload) - not an agent failure');",
          "}",
          "if (pm.response.code === 200 && pm.request.url.getPath() === '/chat') {",
          "    const trace = pm.response.json().trace;",
          "    if (trace) {",
          "        pm.test('Trace budgets (llm_calls <= 4, tokens <= 8000)', () => {",
          "            pm.expect(trace.llm_calls).to.be.at.most(4);",
          "            pm.expect(trace.tokens.total).to.be.at.most(8000);",
          "        });",
          "        console.log(`llm_calls=${trace.llm_calls} tools=${trace.tool_call_count} tokens=${trace.tokens.total} latency=${trace.total_latency_ms}ms`);",
          "    }",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
